# The build context for Dockerfile.console.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS. `COPY . .` in the build stage would otherwise tar node_modules
# (2,888 files / ~115 MB, fully reproducible from the lockfile that IS copied) and a
# local dist/ that the image then overwrites anyway. The sibling project shipped a
# rotted .dockerignore that made one image build tar 5.7 GB and get killed after 15
# minutes; anything large landing in this directory belongs here the same day.
node_modules
dist

# The preview harness. vite.config.ts already refuses to emit it without
# VX_PREVIEW=1, so this is belt and braces rather than the guarantee — but there is
# no reason for a fixtures file naming a fake clinic to be inside a shipped image
# layer at all.
__preview.html
src/__preview.tsx

# Local noise.
.env*
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
